
// application occurrences (of an algorithm to input)
// run at an infrastructure provider for applying algorithms to data
Fact application 

// three types of assets (arrows) are involved in an application 
Fact asset
  Derived from algorithm, input, output
Fact algorithm
Fact input
Fact output

// four roles (nodes) are involved in an application:  
// providers: algorithm provider, data provider, infrastructure provider
// consumer: data consumer
Fact role
  Derived from algorithm-provider, data-provider, infrastructure-provider, consumer
Fact algorithm-provider Derived from actor
Fact data-provider Derived from actor
Fact infrastructure-provider Derived from actor
Fact consumer Derived from actor

// The following relations are populated to determine the source
// and target of the arrows (assets) involved in application occurrences
Fact algorithm-provider-for       Identified by algorithm-provider * application
Fact data-provider-for            Identified by data-provider * application
Fact consumer-for                 Identified by consumer * application
// The following relation determines the role (node) of an application
Fact infrastructure-provider-for  Identified by infrastructure-provider * application

// If agent is infrastructure-provider-fot, it is also infrastructure-provider
Extend Fact infrastructure-provider
  Derived from (Foreach infrastructure-provider-for:
    infrastructure-provider(infrastructure-provider-for.infrastructure-provider)
  )
Extend Fact algorithm-provider
  Derived from (Foreach algorithm-provider-for:
    algorithm-provider(algorithm-provider-for.algorithm-provider)
  )
Extend Fact data-provider
  Derived from (Foreach data-provider-for:
    data-provider(data-provider-for.data-provider)
  )
Extend Fact consumer
  Derived from (Foreach consumer-for:
    consumer(consumer-for.consumer)
  )

// The apply action
Act apply Actor infrastructure-provider
  Related to application, algorithm, input // what about multiple input
                                   , output
  Conditioned by infrastructure-provider-for()
  Holds when True // will be conditioned in subsequent code/specifications 

// Various actions related to sending assets
// A send action is always associated with a single application occurrence
Act send-data Actor data-provider
  Related to application, infrastructure-provider, input
  Conditioned by data-provider-for() 
                ,infrastructure-provider-for()
  Holds when True // will be conditioned in subsequent code/specifications 

Act send-output Actor infrastructure-provider
  Related to application, consumer, output
  Conditioned by consumer-for()
                ,infrastructure-provider-for()
  Holds when True // will be conditioned in subsequent code/specifications

Act send-algorithm Actor algorithm-provider
  Related to application, infrastructure-provider, algorithm
  Conditioned by infrastructure-provider-for()
                ,algorithm-provider-for()
  Holds when True // will be conditioned in subsequent code/specifications

// 1. if no algorithm-provider is given for an application, 
// then the infrastructure-provider is considered to provide algorithm
Extend Fact algorithm-provider-for 
  Derived from algorithm-provider-for(infrastructure-provider, application)
    When  infrastructure-provider-for() 
       && !(Exists algorithm-provider: algorithm-provider-for())

// 2. similar for data-provider
Extend Fact data-provider-for 
  Derived from data-provider-for(infrastructure-provider, application)
    When infrastructure-provider-for() 
      && !(Exists data-provider: data-provider-for())

// 3. and consumer
Extend Fact consumer-for 
  Derived from consumer-for(infrastructure-provider, application)
    When infrastructure-provider-for() 
      && !(Exists consumer: consumer-for())

// Super-action-type of previous send-* actions
Placeholder sender   For role
Placeholder receiver For role
Act send Actor sender
  Related to application, receiver, asset
  Holds when True // can be conditioned by `Extend Act send Conditioned by ...`

Extend Act send-data
  Syncs with send(data-provider, application, infrastructure-provider, input)
Extend Act send-output
  Syncs with send(infrastructure-provider, application, consumer, output)
Extend Act send-algorithm
  Syncs with send(algorithm-provider, application, infrastructure-provider, algorithm)

// graph
Fact edge-type Identified by Input, Algorithm, Output
Fact archetype-edge Identified by sender * receiver * edge-type * application
  Derived from archetype-edge(sender, receiver, Input, application)
    When data-provider-for(sender, application)
      && infrastructure-provider-for(receiver, application)
  Derived from archetype-edge(sender, receiver, Algorithm, application)
    When algorithm-provider-for(sender, application)
      && infrastructure-provider-for(receiver, application)
  Derived from archetype-edge(sender, receiver, Output, application)
    When consumer-for(receiver, application)
      && infrastructure-provider-for(sender, application)
